    "description": "Contemporary Wall Decor\nBlue Druzy Geode Slice with Gold Gilded Edge\nModern Shadow Box Frame, 16\" x 12\"\nThis contemporary wall art piece features a natural geode slice with vibrant blue druzy crystals, enhanced by a hand-applied gold-tone gilded edge. Presented in a deep shadowbox format, the specimen is mounted against a textured linen-style backdrop, creating a sophisticated three-dimensional display that celebrates the intersection of geology and modern interior design.\nNatural crystal geode slice with deep blue dye enhancement and gold-tone gilding\nWood-grain finish shadowbox frame with protective glass front\nDouble-matted presentation including a textured linen-look inner mat\nIntegrated sawtooth hanger on the reverse for easy wall mounting\nMeasures approximately 16\" H x 12\" L x 3\" W\nCondition:\nExcellent pre-owned condition. The crystal specimen is secure and retains vibrant color with intact gilding. The shadowbox frame is structurally sound with the wood-grain finish in clean condition. Matting is free of discoloration or staining. Glass is clear and free of cracks. Backing is intact with sawtooth hanger present.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
